spice
* Differential Amplifier Netlist

* Voltage Supply
VCC 5 0 DC 15V
VEE 6 0 DC -15V

* Load Resistors
RL1 5 3 1k
RL2 7 9 1k

* Current Source
I_EE 4 6 DC 1mA

* Transistors
Q1 3 11 4 NPN
Q2 9 2 4 NPN

* Nodes
* 5 - Positive Supply (VCC)
* 6 - Negative Supply (VEE)
* 4 - Common Emitter Node
* 3 - Collector of Q1
* 9 - Collector of Q2
* 11 - Base of Q1
* 2 - Base of Q2

.end